      <h2>Claiming a slot</h2>
      <p>The Section Coordinator will contact slot winners after the Championship with the USPSA registration deadline. A slot that cannot be used should be returned to the Section Coordinator promptly so it can be reassigned; unused slots go back to USPSA. Questions: <a href="/contact/">contact the Section Coordinator</a>.</p>
